msgid ""
"A temporary address works at once but changes every time the portal starts. "
"An own address needs a Cloudflare account and a domain."
msgstr "临时地址可立即使用，但每次启动平台都会变化。自有地址需要 Cloudflare 账号和域名。"

msgid "Tunnel token (own address)"
msgstr "隧道令牌（自有地址）"

msgid ""
"From the Cloudflare dashboard, when you create the tunnel. You may paste the"
" whole install command. Leave empty to keep the saved token."
msgstr "在 Cloudflare 控制台创建隧道时获得。可以粘贴完整的安装命令。留空则保留已保存的令牌。"

msgid "Public address (HTTPS tunnel)"
msgstr "公网地址（HTTPS 隧道）"

msgid ""
"Your own address, e.g. https://portal.example.com. Not needed for a "
"temporary address."
msgstr "您自己的地址，例如 https://portal.example.com。使用临时地址时无需填写。"

msgid "Everyone must use an authenticator app to sign in"
msgstr "所有人登录时都必须使用验证器应用"

msgid "A token is saved. Paste a new one only to replace it."
msgstr "已保存令牌。仅在需要替换时才粘贴新令牌。"

msgid ""
"This is not a tunnel token. In the Cloudflare dashboard, copy the token (it "
"starts with eyJ) or the whole install command."
msgstr "这不是隧道令牌。请在 Cloudflare 控制台复制令牌（以 eyJ 开头）或完整的安装命令。"

msgid "Enter an address like https://portal.example.com (without a path)."
msgstr "请输入类似 https://portal.example.com 的地址（不带路径）。"

msgid ""
"This is the address of this computer. Enter the address people open, the "
"public hostname of the tunnel in Cloudflare, e.g. "
"https://portal.example.com."
msgstr ""
"这是本机的地址。请输入别人打开的地址，即 Cloudflare 中隧道的公共主机名，例如 https://portal.example.com。"

msgid "Paste the tunnel token from the Cloudflare dashboard."
msgstr "请粘贴 Cloudflare 控制台中的隧道令牌。"

msgid "Enter the address you gave the tunnel in Cloudflare."
msgstr "请输入您在 Cloudflare 中为隧道设置的地址。"

