msgstr "Cloudflare 隧道正在连接…"

msgid "Cloudflare Tunnel is connected."
msgstr "Cloudflare 隧道已连接。"

msgid "Cloudflare Tunnel is not working."
msgstr "Cloudflare 隧道未能正常工作。"

msgid "The portal is ready. Now add the people who will use it."
msgstr "平台已准备就绪。现在请添加将使用平台的人员。"

